Cell["\<\
Zo zadan\[YAcute]ch hodn\[OHat]t treba zisti\[THacek] v\[SHacek]eobecn\
\[UAcute] rovnicu elipsy.
\tEasy: Stred elipsy je v\[ZHacek]dy v bode [0; 0] a pozn\[AAcute]me `a`, `b` \
a `S`.
\tMedium: Stred elipsy je posunut\[YAcute] mimo bodu [0; 0] a pozn\[AAcute]me \
`a`, `b` a `S`.
\tHard: Stred elipsy je posunut\[YAcute] mimo bodu [0; 0] a pozn\[AAcute]me \
`e`, `a` alebo `b` a `S`.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85878071665661*^9, 3.858780728301429*^9}, {
  3.8587892562717085`*^9, 3.8587894953354836`*^9}, {3.8588389121697035`*^9, 
