Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Typ 3 - Elipsa dot\[YAcute]kaj\[UAcute]ca sa os\[IAcute] \
s\[UAcute]radnicovej s\[UAcute]stavy", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.855982452903029*^9, 3.8559824713533244`*^9}, {
   3.8559825504504957`*^9, 3.855982584051509*^9}, {3.855982723349763*^9, 
   3.855982725408393*^9}, 
   3.8568645915002747`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"42818e9b-7985-4753-8648-\
6cc848c50c9f"],

Cell["\<\
Z dotykov\[YAcute]ch bodov X a Y (ktor\[EAcute] s\[UAcute] medzi elipsou a \
osami s\[UAcute]radnicovej s\[UAcute]stavy), treba zisti\[THacek] \
s\[UAcute]radnice stredu elipsy a d\:013a\[ZHacek]ky jej poloos\[IAcute] \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]a\[CloseCurlyQuote] a \[OpenCurlyQuote]b\[CloseCurlyQuote]. \
Potom treba prep\[IAcute]sa\[THacek] stredov\[UAcute] rovnicu tejto elipsy do \
jej v\[SHacek]eobecn\[EAcute]ho tvaru.
\tEasy: Pozn\[AAcute]me obidva body X a Y.
\tMedium: Pozn\[AAcute]me s\[UAcute]radnice iba jedn\[EAcute]ho bodu a druh\
\[YAcute] bod mus\[IAcute]me vypo\[CHacek]\[IAcute]ta\[THacek] z rovnice \
priamky, ktor\[AAcute] prech\[AAcute]dza cez tento bod.
\tHard: Nepozn\[AAcute]me s\[UAcute]radnice bodov X a Y, mus\[IAcute]me ich \
vypo\[CHacek]\[IAcute]ta\[THacek] z rovnice priamky, ktor\[AAcute] prech\
\[AAcute]dza t\[YAcute]mito bodmi.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85878071665661*^9, 3.858780728301429*^9}, 
   3.858790196409197*^9, {3.858790400015704*^9, 3.8587905608729177`*^9}, {
