Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Typ 4 - Elipsa vyjadren\[AAcute] parametrickou rovnicou", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.855982452903029*^9, 3.8559824713533244`*^9}, {
   3.8559825504504957`*^9, 3.855982584051509*^9}, {3.855982698149708*^9, 
   3.855982701443842*^9}, {3.856406239465617*^9, 3.856406242062683*^9}, 
   3.856413342728546*^9},ExpressionUUID->"403ca8b3-ceb9-4068-980b-\
440c676b26cb"],

Cell["\<\
Z parametrickej rovnice elipsy treba zisti\[THacek] jej stred a polomery. N\
\[AAcute]sledne ich vlo\[ZHacek]\[IAcute]me do stredovej rovnice elipsy, ktor\
\[UAcute] prep\[IAcute]\[SHacek]eme na v\[SHacek]eobecn\[UAcute] rovnicu \
elipsy.
\tEasy: Stred elipsy je v\[ZHacek]dy v bode [0; 0].
\tMedium: Stred elipsy je posunut\[YAcute] mimo bodu [0; 0].
\tHard: Stred elipsy je posunut\[YAcute] mimo bodu [0; 0] a parametrick\
\[EAcute] rovnice nie s\[UAcute] vyjadren\[EAcute] v ich z\[AAcute]kladnom \
tvare (rie\[SHacek]ite\:013e ich mus\[IAcute] najprv zjednodu\[SHacek]i\
\[THacek]).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85878071665661*^9, 3.858780728301429*^9}, {
  3.858837998558379*^9, 3.858838022724949*^9}, {3.8588381343383417`*^9, 
