Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Typ 6 - Vz\[AAcute]jomn\[AAcute] poloha bodu a elipsy", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.855982452903029*^9, 3.8559824713533244`*^9}, {
   3.8559825504504957`*^9, 3.855982584051509*^9}, {3.855982698149708*^9, 
   3.855982701443842*^9}, {3.8564062655911446`*^9, 3.8564062808780975`*^9}, 
   3.856413394178067*^9, 
   3.8565935857149234`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"d36b7cab-fb44-406d-8e50-\
883903c922ba"],

Cell["\<\
Pri tomto pr\[IAcute]klade treba ur\[CHacek]i\[THacek] vz\[AAcute]jomn\
\[UAcute] polohu bodu `M` a elipsy. Bod `M` m\[AAcute] rovnak\[UAcute] \
\[SHacek]ancu le\[ZHacek]a\[THacek] na elipse, vo vn\[UAcute]tri elipsy aj \
mimo elipsy.
\tEasy: Je zadan\[YAcute] bod `M`aj stredov\[AAcute] rovnica elipsy. Sta\
\[CHacek]\[IAcute] dosadi\[THacek] s\[UAcute]radnice bodu `M` do rovnice \
elipsy a zisti\[THacek] \[CHacek]i bod le\[ZHacek]\[IAcute] alebo nele\
\[ZHacek]\[IAcute] na elipse.
\tMedium: Je zadan\[YAcute] bod `M`aj stredov\[AAcute] rovnica elipsy. Sta\
\[CHacek]\[IAcute] dosadi\[THacek] s\[UAcute]radnice bodu `M` do rovnice \
elipsy a zisti\[THacek] ich vz\[AAcute]jomn\[UAcute] polohu.
\tHard: Je zadan\[AAcute] iba stredov\[AAcute] rovnica elipsy a dve priamky. \
Bod `M` le\[ZHacek]\[IAcute] na priese\[CHacek]n\[IAcute]ku t\[YAcute]chto \
priamok. Najprv treba zisti\[THacek] s\[UAcute]radnice bodu `M` a potom ho \
sta\[CHacek]\[IAcute] dosadi\[THacek] do rovnice elipsy.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85878071665661*^9, 3.858780728301429*^9}, {
  3.858840477765102*^9, 3.8588404951978817`*^9}, {3.858918719044104*^9, 
  3.8589188452665935`*^9}, {3.858918903666536*^9, 3.858919004340908*^9}, {
  3.858919153517741*^9, 3.8589192732671003`*^9}, {3.8590017122588415`*^9, 
  3.859001922062915*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4358101e-31ee-4e2a-bd91-\
32056bb0ddd3"],

