Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Typ 8 - Vzdialenos\[THacek] priamky od stredu elipsy", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.855982452903029*^9, 3.8559824713533244`*^9}, {
   3.8559825504504957`*^9, 3.855982584051509*^9}, {3.855982698149708*^9, 
   3.855982701443842*^9}, {3.8564062655911446`*^9, 3.8564062683787374`*^9}, {
   3.8564063023807297`*^9, 3.8564063026873703`*^9}, 3.8564133842109494`*^9, {
   3.857297255318227*^9, 
   3.8572972554275684`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"07f96535-b559-4f0d-a491-\
464172c3aa57"],

Cell["\<\
Pri tomto pr\[IAcute]klade treba vypo\[CHacek]\[IAcute]ta\[THacek] vzdialenos\
\[THacek] priamky od stredu elipsy. Najbli\[ZHacek]\[SHacek]\[IAcute] bod k \
stredu elipsy sa nach\[AAcute]dza v\[ZHacek]dy mimo oblasti elipsy.
\tEasy: Elipsa je zap\[IAcute]san\[AAcute] v stredovom tvare, tak\[ZHacek]e \
sta\[CHacek]\[IAcute] si z neho ur\[CHacek]i\[THacek] s\[UAcute]radnice \
stredu a ur\[CHacek]i\[THacek] vzdialenos\[THacek] `d` od priamky `p`.
\tMedium: Elipsa je zap\[IAcute]san\[AAcute] vo v\[SHacek]eobecnom tvare, tak\
\[ZHacek]e sa najprv mus\[IAcute] prep\[IAcute]sa\[THacek] do \
stredov\[EAcute]ho tvaru a potom vieme vypo\[CHacek]\[IAcute]ta\[THacek] \
vzdialenos\[THacek] `d`.
\tHard: Elipsa je zap\[IAcute]san\[AAcute] vo v\[SHacek]eobecnom tvare a \
nepozn\[AAcute]me rovnicu priamky `p`, iba dva body, cez ktor\[EAcute] prech\
\[AAcute]dza, a z nich si mus\[IAcute]me ur\[CHacek]i\[THacek] rovnicu \
priamky.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85878071665661*^9, 3.858780728301429*^9}, 
   3.8588405096374807`*^9, {3.858868527365076*^9, 3.8588686211603594`*^9}, {
   3.8588686708935127`*^9, 3.85886868566768*^9}, {3.85886872802425*^9, 
   3.8588688105232105`*^9}, {3.858868884877654*^9, 3.8588689124470153`*^9}, {
   3.858868947664901*^9, 3.8588690505553503`*^9}, {3.858919328318672*^9, 
   3.858919335225441*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8697c00c-0983-4abb-a92b-\
534f778cc5fe"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ellipseType8", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"problemDifficulty_", ":", "\"\<Easy\>\""}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"debug_", ":", "False"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"difficulty", "=", "1"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
       "standardFormula", "=", 
        "\"\<\!\(\*FractionBox[\(\*SuperscriptBox[\((x - m)\), \(2\)]\(\\\ \)\
\), SuperscriptBox[\(a\), \(2\)]]\) + \
\!\(\*FractionBox[\(\*SuperscriptBox[\((y - n)\), \(2\)]\(\\\ \)\), \
SuperscriptBox[\(b\), \(2\)]]\) = 1\>\""}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
       "distanceFromLineFormula", "=", 
        "\"\<d = \!\(\*FractionBox[RowBox[{\"|\", \
RowBox[{SubscriptBox[\"ax\", \"1\"], \" \", \"+\", \" \", \
SubscriptBox[\"by\", \"1\"], \" \", \"+\", \" \", \"c\"}], \"|\"}], \
SqrtBox[RowBox[{TemplateBox[{\"a\", \"2\"},\"Superscript\"], \" \", \"+\", \" \
\", TemplateBox[{\"b\", \"2\"},\"Superscript\"]}]]]\)\>\""}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
       "lineThrough2PointsFormula", "=", 
        "\"\<y = \!\(\*FractionBox[\(\*SubscriptBox[\(y\), \(2\)] - \
\*SubscriptBox[\(y\), \(1\)]\), \(\*SubscriptBox[\(x\), \(2\)] - \
\*SubscriptBox[\(x\), \(1\)]\)]\) * (x - \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(x\), \(1\)]\)) \
