Cell["\<\
Pri tomto pr\[IAcute]klade treba ur\[CHacek]i\[THacek] vrcholy \
\[SHacek]tvorca KLMN, ktor\[YAcute] je vp\[IAcute]san\[YAcute] do elipsy.
\tEasy: Stred elipsy je v\[ZHacek]dy v bode [0; 0].
\tMedium: Stred elipsy je posunut\[YAcute] mimo bodu [0; 0].
\tHard: Stred elipsy je posunut\[YAcute] mimo bodu [0; 0] a treba navy\
\[SHacek]e vypo\[CHacek]\[IAcute]ta\[THacek] aj obsah \[SHacek]tvorca KLMN.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85878071665661*^9, 3.858780728301429*^9}, 
